  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry Education2010-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ministry Education2010-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donor coordinated support to the implementation of the Strategic      Intitutional Plan 2010-2015 of the Ministry for Education. Other      donors in the basket fund are Holland, Denmark and Spain. Main        objective is to increase enrollement and completion rate in primary   and secondary education, improve education quality and enhance        cultural relevance and technical and productive education.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Givarsamordnat st&#xf6;d till implementeringen av utbildningsministeriets  strategiska institutionella plan 2010-2015.De andra givarna i         basketfonden &#xe4;r NL, DK, ES. Huvudm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka andelen som blir    inskrivna och slutf&#xf6;r grundskola och gymnasium, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten  p&#xe5; utbildningen och st&#xe4;rka den kulturella relevansen, liksom teknisk  utbildning.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PEI (Strategic&#xa0;Intitutional Plan)&#xa0;is the Ministry&#xa0;of Education&#x2019;s mid-term plan for the 2010-2014 period. It is an ambitious plan which aims to transform the education system, based on a pedagogical reform emphasizing a change in values, introduction of intra- and intercultural education and a decolonization process, paying special attention to the poorest, to indigenous populations and marginalized groups. Also, the principle of life-long education is a priority. All the strategic actions in each objective are oriented towards implementing the transformation of the Education System in the short, mid and long term.</narrative>
  </description>
